			<div class="content" id="post-content-2156102">
									

<p>So here are a few ideas I've had.</p>
<p>1. Advertised treatment to cure mental abnormalities actually makes the patients worse off. I actually put this up already but no one responded.</p>
<p>2. A creature that lives in your house with you, but you don't know it. I want to get creative with the Containment Procedures. It doesn't hurt anyone but it drains the food, moves objects around, unlocks doors, and basically makes all the tiny mistakes a shy roommate would make.</p>
<p>3. A person that overhears only negative thoughts pertaining to them, and does something to people who have ill-thinking that usually makes the SCP more depressed with guilt, and more unstable afterwards.</p>
<p>4. A suitcase with various items that will put you through a manic procedure all to erase someone from existence.</p>
<p>5. I'll expand on it, but is there a watch where it ticks at the same rate as your heartbeat anywhere?</p>

