<p>Opinions:</p>
<ul>
<li>2 and 5 are very boring.</li>
<li>4 is really cliché, but could work with some very good, non-forward execution.</li>
<li>1 is really shaky ground, considering how historically this has actually happened lots of times. There's some approaches where it could be entertaining, but it's still a touchy subject.</li>
